# Client UI

- New user-visible copy goes through `useTranslation` (`client/src/i18n/`), not hardcoded English.
- Ant Design v6 `Space`: prop is `orientation`, not `direction`.
- Public blog HTML must be sanitized with DOMPurify before render.
